{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid48", "sentence_id": "s001", "text": "你好，今天的会议改到下午3点半开始。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.458, "n_samples": 82980, "proc_s": 1.1826, "rtf": 0.342, "samples_sha256": "ba67907b009197535ca6609123dbdcac392dae451c61eb42d2170159452c65ab"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid48", "sentence_id": "s002", "text": "我刚买了一部新的iPhone，用起来很顺手。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.927, "n_samples": 94253, "proc_s": 1.563, "rtf": 0.398, "samples_sha256": "c9ce87fa8819841f6649929cd66135cc7ae3b21f4391f349d568c6e01362f097"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid48", "sentence_id": "s003", "text": "这件衣服打折以后只要128元。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.885, "n_samples": 69230, "proc_s": 0.9073, "rtf": 0.3145, "samples_sha256": "7f312923ac2128bd81b3e7785a5d078f209e1431ea6e05ba77c31640b0e08c31"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid48", "sentence_id": "s004", "text": "我们约在2026年10月20日见面吧。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.011, "n_samples": 72264, "proc_s": 0.9692, "rtf": 0.3219, "samples_sha256": "157139d7d12eac2a7ea46da2732acbc0d2503445b5432d6b5b781694ea5f9101"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid48", "sentence_id": "s005", "text": "请把报告在周五之前发给我。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.376, "n_samples": 57020, "proc_s": 0.8338, "rtf": 0.351, "samples_sha256": "20ebdad9f183beac68dcc5d8e374cfa7d07a92bc47e82708d544dca47b698822"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid48", "sentence_id": "s006", "text": "现在的AI工具越来越好用了。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.76, "n_samples": 66239, "proc_s": 1.0031, "rtf": 0.3634, "samples_sha256": "051b5b464eceb61116037ff66b5ad4cf1c5a5f07e6bfe48e038ed8b2720af39b"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid48", "sentence_id": "s007", "text": "你的航班几点起飞？我记得是早上8点20分。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.873, "n_samples": 92948, "proc_s": 1.3043, "rtf": 0.3368, "samples_sha256": "ece7b707ec9bed0a9f80b60c33d162f98e37a7d0120f8a423167ce1ee328d85c"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid48", "sentence_id": "s008", "text": "这个月的电费一共是356块钱。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.997, "n_samples": 71936, "proc_s": 0.8725, "rtf": 0.2911, "samples_sha256": "798ded448daa859ce5c8f049e792fcb642a2ac50fa0ad30a4035580534b326f9"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid48", "sentence_id": "s009", "text": "我住在3楼，电梯就在门口右边。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.034, "n_samples": 72806, "proc_s": 1.1261, "rtf": 0.3712, "samples_sha256": "6c4c833cb0613fccdb3ec0fb6eaebe6901a4b857c632aa5fce944e7ea7241b52"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid48", "sentence_id": "s010", "text": "他每天跑步5公里，已经坚持了两年。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.26, "n_samples": 78231, "proc_s": 1.3079, "rtf": 0.4012, "samples_sha256": "8a3ac07b30e8cac379452788c5690a136c5c2b2893d9d0199da59d4d91cf3065"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid48", "sentence_id": "s011", "text": "下周一我们要去上海出差。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.265, "n_samples": 54355, "proc_s": 0.7427, "rtf": 0.328, "samples_sha256": "058ef19cd67c63628d238699fc5f15295173261d3a14668c9e338dd9bf7e354b"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid48", "sentence_id": "s012", "text": "你能帮我订一张明天去北京的高铁票吗？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.188, "n_samples": 76504, "proc_s": 0.9783, "rtf": 0.3069, "samples_sha256": "8cd5a8ff8a0a9b27c0ba8dc0677eb3126eb03fc63ff4f7e5128fcf01f4c21d04"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid48", "sentence_id": "s013", "text": "这家餐厅的评分是4.8分，值得一试。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.528, "n_samples": 84682, "proc_s": 1.4514, "rtf": 0.4114, "samples_sha256": "ffca2649d943041c28b480d5a1cf39c1b77c0077a5205f74700cf1371bc6a14c"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid48", "sentence_id": "s014", "text": "我的手机号是13812345678，有事打给我。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.375, "n_samples": 104998, "proc_s": 1.556, "rtf": 0.3557, "samples_sha256": "0e6f8acff6bb42796869b35a6f1c21fe8bde4995de933f7fe9208eaa5865853a"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid48", "sentence_id": "s015", "text": "今年公司的销售额增长了15%。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.203, "n_samples": 76875, "proc_s": 1.1094, "rtf": 0.3463, "samples_sha256": "b0d998b5f3f9044fc2fcac7c53f53804718893d8bc39e07a6efe75dd65fec7b8"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid48", "sentence_id": "s016", "text": "孩子们放学以后在公园里踢足球。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.854, "n_samples": 68506, "proc_s": 0.8469, "rtf": 0.2967, "samples_sha256": "56fa813167a6109fdbf6e267dbe0ef4255b724d86f69a78d0ec6a8838bfadf1c"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid48", "sentence_id": "s017", "text": "我用微信给你转了2000块，记得查收。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.245, "n_samples": 77890, "proc_s": 1.3139, "rtf": 0.4049, "samples_sha256": "df2b84904fca48b2b9836b534d38dc9b0f9a54c4a6de54fa7ae05edd1cebef90"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid48", "sentence_id": "s018", "text": "天气预报说明天最高气温32度。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.927, "n_samples": 70252, "proc_s": 0.873, "rtf": 0.2982, "samples_sha256": "84c76ae6ef79a32929f546ab56db1ce04e2728650595faa1e95e5dbb11ae594a"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid48", "sentence_id": "s019", "text": "请问洗手间在哪里？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 1.746, "n_samples": 41907, "proc_s": 0.5849, "rtf": 0.335, "samples_sha256": "229049e2f5881181dc21ef9e25c3b2febf7127b612a5823eae2bc5928d2ece54"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid48", "sentence_id": "s020", "text": "我们的Zoom会议链接已经发到群里了。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.266, "n_samples": 78375, "proc_s": 1.2204, "rtf": 0.3737, "samples_sha256": "946b6839519233670ef05bfe6fe48eca57eb03663c434b4bc5d3cef1056a19d8"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid48", "sentence_id": "s021", "text": "这本书我看了一半，故事特别精彩。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.043, "n_samples": 73033, "proc_s": 1.1236, "rtf": 0.3692, "samples_sha256": "4fc335e52ccb9f5a41524bb20c85629ec59d0682dd7317c40f8d0406a3ad9e6c"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid48", "sentence_id": "s022", "text": "他的生日是5月4日，我们准备给他一个惊喜。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.791, "n_samples": 90973, "proc_s": 1.2932, "rtf": 0.3412, "samples_sha256": "2a07f4c264bf44afe90e00c99973c09995eb10c4ae808b47b2717e28e8c34094"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid48", "sentence_id": "s023", "text": "从这里打车到机场大概需要40分钟。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.205, "n_samples": 76909, "proc_s": 0.9269, "rtf": 0.2892, "samples_sha256": "2a467ffe8808fb51333dc6467454fe7c17b8e7a054a971e494142ff879e59f09"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid48", "sentence_id": "s024", "text": "我刚下载了ChatGPT的新版本。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.482, "n_samples": 83564, "proc_s": 1.3849, "rtf": 0.3977, "samples_sha256": "e01ab2f375b96a21cd960385c2c14b6b44d5b003929e96c6ce1b212c13fa9fb3"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid48", "sentence_id": "s025", "text": "房租每个月涨了500元，真让人头疼。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.329, "n_samples": 79900, "proc_s": 1.2591, "rtf": 0.3782, "samples_sha256": "4c4562d9d4991a5c554ea6dbeb3075d4d6afa59e6f03b709886deff6c16b9859"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid48", "sentence_id": "s026", "text": "周末你想去看电影还是去爬山？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.739, "n_samples": 65745, "proc_s": 0.8583, "rtf": 0.3133, "samples_sha256": "ed89ff77e391acff6dbcccb321d8f8b49e96f63a99fb402a6e2a68564b130106"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid48", "sentence_id": "s027", "text": "这台笔记本电脑的价格是6999元。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.668, "n_samples": 88038, "proc_s": 1.2598, "rtf": 0.3434, "samples_sha256": "c46956d2aa6025afaef756fb8bc2a48cf9cdb281ec88219eeafae4dabf9989d2"}
